bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone, 
We are back with some more adjustments
and a new BGM track!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario
[/b][/center]

[b]1.1.5b[/b]
o Bugfixes

[b]1.1.5[/b]
o Added a BGM track that plays in the shop in the subclass round.

[b]Balancing[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Boiling Pot: Heal 8 -> 10, speed increase 10% -> 15%
o Gold Armor: Attack slow 35% -> 50% 
o Pineapple: Cooldown 3.1s -> 2.9s
o Pine Protector: Heal 6 -> 8
o King of the Bling: Restock chance 60% -> 70%
o Investment Opportunity: Maximum health 5 -> 6
o Power of the Moon: Blind (Moon Armor) 1 -> 2
o Echoing Battlecry: Bonus speed 55% -> 60%
o Superspacious: Trigger speed 14% -> 15%, sales chance 40% -> 45%
o Uniquely Unique: Treasure chance 60% -> 65%
o Ice Armor: Block 90 -> 100, cooldown 5s -> 4.7s
o Frozen Buckler: Stamina reduction 0.8 -> 0.9
o Frostbite: Vampirism 8 -> 10
o Ice Dragon: Block 75 -> 80

[center][b]Ranger[/b][/center]
o White Lily Collar: Luck/Regeneration chance 30% -> 25%
o Blue Sage Collar: Mana chance per Luck 5% -> 6%

[center][b]Reaper[/b][/center]
o Cauldron: Cooldown 2.7s -> 2.6s
o War Scythe: Damage +2
o Frog Prince: Cooldown 3.2s -> 2.9s

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Burning Banner: Cooldown 4s -> 4.2s
o Molten Greatsword: Empower 3 -> 4
o Turbo Shelly: Cooldown 11.5s -> 12s
o Sapphire Whelp: Block 8 -> 10

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Shaman Mask: Cooldown 3.2 -> 3.4s
o Spiked Staff: Spikes 3 -> 4
o Chain Whip: Heal 10 -> 12

[center][b]Mage[/b][/center]
o Cat Spirit Companion: Cooldown 3s -> 2.7s
o Death Lotus: Cooldown 3.2s -> 3.0s
o Wand of Dissonance: Cooldown 3.3s -> 3.1s

[center][b]Adventurer[/b][/center]
o Superior Ring: Health-based and start-of-battle amounts 
   slightly increased

[center][b]Engineer[/b][/center]
o Electric Torch: Blind 6 -> 7, duration 6s -> 7s
o Eat-o-matic: Other food speed 50% -> 60%
o Gigawatz: Trigger speed 10% -> 15%"
